      "html": "<div contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"padding:20px; font-size:1.1rem; outline:none; font-weight:300; min-width:150px;\"><div><span style=\"font-size: 17.6px;\">The building grows from the roots and expands on the upper part to form a large mushroomshaped</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 17.6px;\">body that occupies the sky-viewing area.&nbsp;</span>First, build a new frame on the old building in Hong Kong, the concrete boundary is the high limit, and the original roof. Then the&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 1.1rem;\">structure was built to create a reasonable space for the citizens to use. In order to communicate between buildings, it is very important for architectural elements to connect during the growth process.</span></div></div>",
